From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Subject: [PATCH] build: Recognize the openRuyi riscv64 triplet

The bundled config.sub predates riscv64-openruyi-linux; normalize that
triplet to the GNU ABI form expected by this configure script.

Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
diff --git a/build-aux/config.sub b/build-aux/config.sub
--- a/build-aux/config.sub
+++ b/build-aux/config.sub
@@ -116,0 +117,9 @@
+case $1 in
+ riscv64-openruyi-linux)
+   echo "$1-gnu"
+   exit 0;;
+ riscv64-openruyi-linux-gnu)
+   echo "$1"
+   exit 0;;
+esac
+
